{"game": "redfall", "language": "english", "appid": 1294810, "month": "2026-05", "window": 1, "start_date": 1777593600, "end_date": 1780271999, "month_true_total": 8, "quota": 8, "returned": 8, "pulled_at": "2026-09-02 17:07:00 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "226724852", "author": {"steamid": "76561199073349075", "personaname": "Leedle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/leedle999/", "num_games_owned": 1329, "num_reviews": 383, "playtime_forever": 128, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 128, "last_played": 1779651946, "avatar": "b03e5831025fd24b49393342c67630afe4f7090e"}, "language": "english", "review": "2 hours in and this game is amazing! Idk what it was like at launch i heard it was broken and lacking in a lot of areas. In 2026 it's an amazing and polished game so far. It's basically open world Dishonored with Vampires. Gamers these days are like star wars fans. They hate their preferred medium more than anyone. \n\nTLDR: Solid and enjoyable open world Dishonored with Vampires. Ignore the haters it's fun.", "timestamp_created": 1780085977, "timestamp_updated": 1780085977, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.48505595326423645", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 28, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "226273988", "author": {"steamid": "76561197985463471", "personaname": "Enik", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/pureobscure/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 867, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 867, "last_played": 1753059469, "avatar": "43856e20ef912d59e22166e59e91f99db2b99526"}, "language": "english", "review": "If this game were made by an unknown studio I think the reviews would be much more forgiving. The expectations from Arkane were huge so of course people would be disappointed.\n\nIt's definitely flawed. The world is largely empty and repetitive, the difficulty spiked weirdly, there's not nearly enough weapon diversity for a looter shooter type of game, and the skills and ultimate abilities were largely worthless. The ultimates on the two characters I tried actually disrupted game flow instead of giving you an edge -- really not well thought out at all. And once I made it to the second map and saw that everything was just rinse and repeat I stopped playing.\n\nThere were things I liked though. I think it looked good on max settings and the overall ambiance was well done. Sound design was good. I thought the procedural dungeons were fun. And the weapons (at first) were pretty cool. There was a quest line about a[spoiler]sick daughter and her father accidentally killing her[/spoiler]that was enjoyable and pretty powerful.\n\nI paid almost nothing for this game so I feel inclined to give it a positive review. It is pretty absurd that it still has Denuvo though and I suspect no one is working on trying to bypass it on this game lol.", "timestamp_created": 1779591157, "timestamp_updated": 1779592262, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.489319324493408203", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32404", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 9 9950X 16-Core Processor            ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080", "vram_size": 15977}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225608925", "author": {"steamid": "76561198052674173", "personaname": "SkyeRise", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198052674173/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 177, "playtime_forever": 523, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 523, "last_played": 1778883164, "avatar": "027710dfe5b50c36062d6da0bce8306fcc19f5e2"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game has its weaknesses, but it is still a fun experience I return to periodically. This time around, I played with the infinite ammo option because I had already finished legit twice before and it gave everything a new funny twist.\n\nIf you can get it under 20 bucks, it is definitely worth picking up!", "timestamp_created": 1778883244, "timestamp_updated": 1778883244, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.462530463933944702", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225534175", "author": {"steamid": "76561198128335416", "personaname": "Gastoff", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198128335416/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 150, "playtime_forever": 814, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 590, "last_played": 1780133792, "avatar": "75389315d0b9d5c39d260d417857bf0e51c96982"}, "language": "english", "review": "I really like it so far. I cant think of another game that lets me pretend I'm Blade. The vampires even perish in a similar visual fashion. It's also set in beautiful New England!\r\n\r\nA solid FPS with a decent story and gameplay. It's a bit too easy, even on max difficulty, but better that than the reverse. There are things that could be improved but overall it's enjoyable if purchased for a reasonable price.", "timestamp_created": 1778820301, "timestamp_updated": 1778820301, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.490398794412612915", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "r